ts or programs requiring the integration of cross-functional technology and/or business solutions.","source_heading":"Preferred Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum five (5) years experience implementing large, complex projects in a corporate environment.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Five (5) years experience working with an IT Infrastructure Library (ITIL) framework.","source_heading":"Preferred Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum five (5) years experience leading project teams.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum ten (10) years experience managing project budgets.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Drives the execution of multiple work streams by identifying customer and operational needs; developing and updating new procedures and policies; gaining cross-functional support for objectives and priorities; translating business strategy into actionable business requirements; obtaining and distributing resources; setting standards and measuring progress; removing obstacles that impact performance; guiding performance and developing contingency plans accordingly; solving highly complex issues; and influencing the completion of project tasks by others.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Practices self-leadership and promotes learning in others by soliciting and acting on performance feedback; building collaborative, cross-functional relationships; communicating information and providing advice to drive projects forward; adapting to competing demands and new responsibilities; providing feedback to others, including upward feedback to leadership; influencing, mentoring, and coaching team members; fostering open dialogue amongst team members; evaluating and responding to the strengths and weaknesses of self and unit members; and adapting to and learning from change, difficulties, and feedback.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Oversees the delivery of IT infrastructure and operations capabilities for large-scale programs for assigned business initiatives from planning to completion.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Analyzes, integrates, and manages complex project/program plans which include scope, status, schedules, and resource forecasts.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Manages and monitors the program financials of large and complex projects/programs.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Monitors overall program performance (e.g., on time, on budget, within scope, up to quality standards) against plan and makes adjustments as needed.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Oversees project/program activities related to organizational change management (e.g., development and execution of user adoption, implementation, and training plans) as defined by the project.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Promotes, refines, and oversees adherence to established processes and policies (e.g. SDLC including domain standards, Kaiser standards).","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Assists in the establishment and management of proper project management practices in regard to allocation of resources, schedules and task assignments.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Drives the completion of the work of multiple program teams.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Evaluates internal and/or external resources and provides feedback on team composition based on the alignment of team member skills and project/program demands.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Creates and communicates a clear vision of project/program goals and objectives to the team.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Delivers individual performance feedback to team members.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Manages, monitors and mitigates risks across multiple, interdependent projects or programs by analyzing and identifying trigger events.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Monitors the compliance of project/program plans by ensuring team members follow policies and procedures.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ensures the alignment, buy-in, engagement and support of diverse project stakeholders by building and maintaining relationships as well as communicating appropriately with internal customers, third party vendors, and business leadership.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ensures success of project by identifying and working closely with the right stakeholders based on their level of influence and decision making.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Determines program goals, influences the prioritization of deliverables, coordinates all business processes (e.g. project change management, communication) and facilitates decisions necessary for program delivery by partnering with program sponsors and/or review boards.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Communicates tough issues to stakeholders and keeps an independent opinion.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Reviews vendor performance to provide direction for service improvements or revisions to strategy.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Facilitates contract negotiations with service vendors, and reviews and resolves issues with vendor invoices.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ambiguity/Uncertainty Management","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Analytical Skills","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_t